			description: ["&7All tools will have a random &erarity&7. This will affect their stats. To improve the rarity, you can &ereforge the tools&7 using the second tab in the anvil. You will require &ea tool-specific material&7 and &eone of the 3 ores&7 to successfully change its rarity. &cYou can read the \"Reforging\" tutorial for more info!"]
